                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino webo, sa ulaliyandawida zintu zipati? Utaziyandauli pe. Nkaambo ncobeni njooletela bantu boonse buyo mapenzi, mbwaamba Jehova, pele buumi bwako, njookupa mbubo bube bulumbu bwako koonse koonse kufumbwa nkoya.",
          "type": "text",
